[TITLE]
SIM-22: pump PU1 and GPV V1 in series carry a fixed 100 gpm from R1 to J2
The pump's head gain and the GPV's head loss are read straight off their curves.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     0
 J2   0     100

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   0

[PUMPS]
;ID   N1  N2  Parameters
 PU1  R1  J1  HEAD PC1

[VALVES]
;ID  N1  N2  Diam  Type  Setting
 V1  J1  J2  12    GPV   GC1

[CURVES]
;ID  Flow (gpm)  Head (ft)
 PC1  100        50       ; pump curve: 50 ft at 100 gpm
 PC2  100        80       ; pump curve: 80 ft at 100 gpm
 GC1  0          0        ; GPV curve: 10 ft at 100 gpm
 GC1  200        20
 GC2  0          0        ; GPV curve: 30 ft at 100 gpm
 GC2  200        60

[TIMES]
 Duration  0

[OPTIONS]
 Units     GPM
 Headloss  H-W

[END]
